! lobsterin for CsI3, matched to CsI3/wannier90.win
! Wannier projections:  I:p only   (36 functions per cell, no Cs functions)
! Wannier windows: outer -6 to 3 eV, frozen -5 to 3 eV absolute, E_F = 0.6837 eV (OUTCAR)
!   The lower cut is placed at the frozen-window edge, -5 eV absolute = -5.68 eV relative to E_F.
!   It selects the same bands as the outer window (the I 5p manifold, bands 29-64) but sits
!   mid-gap, 1.8 eV above the Cs 5p semicore bands at -6.9 eV, instead of 0.8 eV above them.
!   Dropped: Cs 5s, I 5s, Cs 5p.  Upper cut: 3 eV absolute = 2.32 eV relative to E_F.
! LOBSTER needs at least one function on every atom, so Cs gets its empty 6s only.
basisSet pbeVaspFit2015
basisfunctions Cs 6s
basisfunctions I 5p
COHPstartEnergy -5.68
COHPendEnergy 2.32
cohpGenerator from 1.4 to 20
